OL,3,AThousands of teens missing education
OL,4,A'under the radar' of official stats,
OL,5,Areport warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere could be tens of thousands more
OL,8,Fteenagers who are not in education,
OL,9,Femployment or training (Neet) than
OL,10,Fofficial statistics suggest, the
OL,11,Fchildren's commissioner for England has
OL,12,Fwarned.
OL,14,FA report by Dame Rachel de Souza said
OL,15,Faround 42,000 16- and 17-year-olds in
OL,16,FEngland were officially classed as
OL,17,Fstudying at college, but were not
OL,18,Fshowing up at least half of the time.
OL,20,FShe said they had gone "under the
OL,21,Fradar" and were "not getting the
OL,22,Fsupport that they need".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
